Package: qpatterns
Title: Quantile patterns
Version: 0.3.0
Date: 2026-10-20
Authors@R: c(person("Guillaume", "Rousselet", email = "Guillaume.Rousselet@glasgow.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre")),
             person("Rand", "Wilcox", email = "rwilcox@usc.edu", role = "aut"))
Maintainer: Guillaume Rousselet <Guillaume.Rousselet@glasgow.ac.uk>
Description: Explore and test distributional patterns using graphical methods and quantile inferences.
    Quantiles are estimated using the Harrell-Davis (1982) estimator, which can handle tied values. 
    Quantiles and combinations of quantiles are compared using bootstrap inferences.
    Graphical representations rely on `ggplot2`.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.3.2)
